---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage title="Privacy policy" description="Read how Font Finder handles information and uploaded images." canonical="https://fontfinder.com/privacy-policy" eyebrow="Last updated: September 5, 2026">
	<p class="text-lg leading-8 text-ink">Your privacy matters. This policy explains the information Font Finder handles when you use our website.</p>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Images you upload</h2><p class="mt-3">The current Font Finder demo processes image selections in your browser. We do not intentionally store uploaded images on our servers. Do not upload images containing sensitive personal information, confidential material, or content you do not have permission to use.</p></section>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Information you provide</h2><p class="mt-3">If you contact us, we may receive the information in your message, such as your name, email address, and any attachments. We use it to respond to you and to maintain or improve Font Finder.</p></section>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Cookies and analytics</h2><p class="mt-3">We may use essential technologies needed to operate the site and may collect limited, aggregated usage information to understand how the site performs. This information is used to maintain, secure, and improve the service.</p></section>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Sharing and retention</h2><p class="mt-3">We do not sell personal information. We may share information with service providers that help operate the website, when required by law, or to protect the rights, safety, and security of Font Finder and its users. We retain contact information only as long as reasonably needed for the purpose it was collected.</p></section>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Your choices</h2><p class="mt-3">You may contact us to ask about personal information associated with a message you sent us. For questions about this policy, email <a class="font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-link" href="mailto:hello@fontfinder.com">hello@fontfinder.com</a>.</p></section>
</InfoPage>
